IDENTIFICATION DIVISION
PROGRAM-ID. MULTIPLICATION

DATA DIVISION. 
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 

01 X          PIC 9(3) VALUE 12. 
01 Y          PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
01 PRODUCT    PIC 9(5). 

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE PRODUCT = X * Y
    DISPLAY "Multiplication: " X " * " y " = " PRODUCT
    STOP RUN. 
